      "text": "Electroacupuncture enhances traditional acupuncture by applying electrical pulses through needles. This stimulation is believed to modulate pain pathways via endorphin release, improve circulation, reduce inflammation, and regulate nerve activity. Different frequencies may engage distinct neurochemical mechanisms."
